#: inc/panel.php:568
msgid "Reading Time"
msgstr ""

#: inc/panel.php:575
msgid "Shows an estimated reading time (e.g. \"5 min read\") in the single post meta line, right-aligned next to the date/author/views. Computed at 200 words per minute (international average) and cached when the post is saved."
